{"segment_id": "segment_00012", "start": 360.0, "end": 390.0, "speech": "呃，最后一个 topic for discussion，这是完全自由的对话，既练习我们的准确性，又练习我们的流畅性。但是我们现在还没有办法去做，我们的水平呢还没有达到那一步。但是话题我们可以提前去理解。第一个说，Do you enjoy moving house, changing the furniture in your room? Why, why not?你喜欢搬家吗？啊，把你房子房间里的这个家具改一改吗？为什么？为什么不？What sorts of books do you like reading?", "frames": [{"path": "frames/frame_000055.webp", "time": 360.0, "ocr": {"texts": ["Topics for discussion", "训练目标：", "完全自由的对话"], "scores": [0.99802, 0.95745, 0.99942], "boxes": [[[57.0, 137.0], [560.0, 137.0], [560.0, 197.0], [57.0, 197.0]], [[108.0, 333.0], [341.0, 333.0], [341.0, 394.0], [108.0, 394.0]], [[108.0, 397.0], [469.0, 397.0], [469.0, 460.0], [108.0, 460.0]]]}}, {"path": "frames/frame_000056.webp", "time": 369.0, "ocr": {"texts": ["Topics for discussion", "Do you enjoy moving house/changing", "the furniture in your room? Why/Why", "not?", "What sorts of books do you like reading?", "Give reasons for your choice(s).", "Some people prefer watching television", "to reading books. Can television take the", "place of books? why/ Why not?"], "scores": [0.99781, 0.98943, 0.99299, 0.99098, 0.99574, 0.97086, 0.99632, 0.99388, 0.96673], "boxes": [[[57.0, 135.0], [560.0, 135.0], [560.0, 198.0], [57.0, 198.0]], [[185.0, 326.0], [1078.0, 330.0], [1078.0, 405.0], [185.0, 402.0]], [[188.0, 390.0], [1046.0, 394.0], [1046.0, 463.0], [188.0, 459.0]], [[189.0, 457.0], [304.0, 453.0], [307.0, 512.0], [192.0, 516.0]], [[189.0, 529.0], [1133.0, 535.0], [1133.0, 604.0], [189.0, 597.0]], [[190.0, 595.0], [916.0, 598.0], [916.0, 663.0], [190.0, 660.0]], [[189.0, 676.0], [1114.0, 676.0], [1114.0, 744.0], [189.0, 744.0]], [[192.0, 743.0], [1131.0, 739.0], [1131.0, 799.0], [192.0, 802.0]], [[194.0, 803.0], [912.0, 803.0], [912.0, 866.0], [194.0, 866.0]]]}}], "review_flags": [], "asr_model": "Qwen/Qwen3-ASR-1.7B"}
